  "title": "Amount of vs Number of vs Quantity of – Grammar Shorts",
  "description": "Number of, amount of и quantity of выбираются по типу noun и смыслу количества.",
  "theory": {
    "rule_id": "RULE-Grammar Shorts-3-RU",
    "lesson_num": 3,
    "title": "Правила: Amount of vs Number of vs Quantity of – Grammar Shorts",
    "level": "SHORTS",
    "overview": "Number of, amount of и quantity of выбираются по типу noun и смыслу количества.",
    "main_rule": "Number of → plural countable nouns. Amount of → uncountable nouns. Quantity of → countable or uncountable, especially measurable quantity.",
    "form": "the/a large number of + plural noun. the/a large amount of + uncountable. the/a large quantity of + countable/uncountable.",
    "when_why": "Countable employees/questions → number. Uncountable money/information/traffic → amount. Measurable quantity → quantity.",
    "examples": "The number of employees has increased. → Количество сотрудников увеличилось.\nThe amount of traffic has increased. → Объём трафика увеличился.\nA large quantity of water was needed. → Потребовалось большое количество воды.",
    "special_cases": "Quantity of can occur with both countable and uncountable; it focuses on measurable quantity.",
    "common_mistakes": "❌ the amount of employees → ✅ the number of employees.\n❌ a number of money → ✅ an amount of money.",
    "dont_confuse": "Сначала countable or uncountable?",
    "quick_summary": "number → plural countable.\namount → uncountable.\nquantity → both, measurable."
  },
